    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 800593164957497254, guid: 401ef9873e403d141bc2b05e37a154c7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageText
      value: '(Sigh...)



        All my money was spent on this maddening journey.
        I can''t go back home.



        Oh, the knowledge... the promised knowledge...



        This
        beautiful city is imprinted in my mind like a never-ending nightmare.



        I
        want to see flowers again.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
